---
source: crates/test-framework/src/snapshot/mod.rs
description: "Query: clickbench_q40"
---
+---------------+------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| plan_type     | plan                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     |
+---------------+------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| logical_plan  | Federated                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                |
|               |  Limit: skip=1000, fetch=10                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              |
|               |   Sort: PageViews DESC NULLS FIRST                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       |
|               |     Projection: hits.TraficSourceID, hits.SearchEngineID, hits.AdvEngineID, CASE WHEN hits.SearchEngineID = Int64(0) AND hits.AdvEngineID = Int64(0) THEN hits.Referer ELSE Utf8("") END AS Src, hits.URL AS Dst, count(Int64(1)) AS PageViews                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           |
|               |       Aggregate: groupBy=[[hits.TraficSourceID, hits.SearchEngineID, hits.AdvEngineID, CASE WHEN CAST(hits.SearchEngineID AS Int64) = Int64(0) AND CAST(hits.AdvEngineID AS Int64) = Int64(0) THEN hits.Referer ELSE CAST(Utf8("") AS LargeUtf8) END, hits.URL]], aggr=[[count(Int64(1))]]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               |
|               |         TableScan: hits projection=[URL, Referer, TraficSourceID, SearchEngineID, AdvEngineID], full_filters=[CAST(hits.CounterID AS Int64) = Int64(62), CAST(date_trunc(Utf8("day"), from_unixtime(hits.EventTime)) AS Timestamp(ns)) >= CAST(Utf8("2013-07-01") AS Timestamp(ns)), CAST(date_trunc(Utf8("day"), from_unixtime(hits.EventTime)) AS Timestamp(ns)) <= CAST(Utf8("2013-07-31") AS Timestamp(ns)), CAST(hits.IsRefresh AS Int64) = Int64(0)]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               |
| physical_plan | SchemaCastScanExec                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       |
|               |   CooperativeExec                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        |
|               |     BytesProcessedExec                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   |
|               |       VirtualExecutionPlan name=sqlite compute_context=//data/accelerated_sqlite.db base_sql=SELECT `hits`.`TraficSourceID`, `hits`.`SearchEngineID`, `hits`.`AdvEngineID`, CASE WHEN ((CAST(`hits`.`SearchEngineID` AS BIGINT) = 0) AND (CAST(`hits`.`AdvEngineID` AS BIGINT) = 0)) THEN `hits`.`Referer` ELSE CAST('' AS TEXT) END AS `Src`, `hits`.`URL` AS `Dst`, count(1) AS `PageViews` FROM `hits` WHERE ((((CAST(`hits`.`CounterID` AS BIGINT) = 62) AND (CAST(strftime('%Y-%m-%d', datetime(`hits`.`EventTime`, 'unixepoch')) AS TEXT) >= CAST('2013-07-01' AS TEXT))) AND (CAST(strftime('%Y-%m-%d', datetime(`hits`.`EventTime`, 'unixepoch')) AS TEXT) <= CAST('2013-07-31' AS TEXT))) AND (CAST(`hits`.`IsRefresh` AS BIGINT) = 0)) GROUP BY `hits`.`TraficSourceID`, `hits`.`SearchEngineID`, `hits`.`AdvEngineID`, CASE WHEN ((CAST(`hits`.`SearchEngineID` AS BIGINT) = 0) AND (CAST(`hits`.`AdvEngineID` AS BIGINT) = 0)) THEN `hits`.`Referer` ELSE CAST('' AS TEXT) END, `hits`.`URL` ORDER BY `PageViews` DESC NULLS FIRST LIMIT 10 OFFSET 1000 |
|               |                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          |
+---------------+------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
